secubox-metoblizer (1.0.1-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * fix: package never installed the api (bare "dh $@" rules) so the service
    crash-looped 4042x (200/CHDIR: missing WorkingDirectory) and also called a
    nonexistent /usr/bin/uvicorn. Add override_dh_auto_install (api, www,
    menu.d, nginx, config) and switch ExecStart to python3 -m uvicorn. Service
    now runs; API serves.

